    "title": "Somerset shooting death determined to be accidental - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madolin Edwards ,\n1 days ago\nState police in Somerset have ruled a July 31 death in the borough as accidental.\nTroopers were called at 5:05 p.m. to investigate a shooting in the 600 block of Walnut Street. They reported Gary Brewer, 46, Somerset, suffered a fatal gunshot wound from an accidental discharge. Police said there was no threat to the public.\nThis article originally appeared on The Daily American: Somerset shooting death determined to be accidental\n2",
